flowchart TB
  CUST[Signed-in customer browser]
  HF[Contoso Pay hosted field]
  STEP[Payment step endpoint]
  SUB[Payment submission handler]
  MGR[Saved card manager]
  PAY[Contoso Pay API]
  DB[(Portal database)]
  ACC[Account cards endpoint]
  CUST -->|requests payment step| STEP
  STEP -->|cards, cap state| CUST
  CUST -->|card number, CVV| HF
  HF -->|one-time token| CUST
  CUST -->|token, save flag| SUB
  SUB -->|charge request| PAY
  PAY -->|approved or declined| SUB
  SUB -->|save when approved| MGR
  MGR -->|token, brand, last four| DB
  SUB -->|result, cap message| CUST
  CUST -->|remove card request| ACC
  ACC -->|delete owned record| MGR
  MGR -->|token deletion call| PAY